# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Qalam — production edge reverse proxy TEMPLATE (nginx)
#
# This file is intentionally ALL COMMENTED OUT. It documents the intended
# production topology; render a concrete config by replacing DOMAIN with the
# real domain, uncommenting, and reviewing every value.
#
#   app.DOMAIN    → frontend static bundle
#   admin.DOMAIN  → admin static bundle
#   api.DOMAIN    → NestJS API (upstream :4000)
#
# TLS: use certbot (`certbot --nginx -d api.DOMAIN -d app.DOMAIN -d admin.DOMAIN`)
# or provision certs out-of-band and point ssl_certificate/_key at them.
# certbot rewrites the listen directives to 443 ssl and adds the cert paths.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

